# PHASE 3 — Roadmap (appendix, not Phase-1/2 sprints)

These are **out of the engine's text-to-text scope** or depend on accumulated data; specified at roadmap level only:
- **Omnichannel parity** — the same engine already serves `channel="whatsapp"|"voice"`; full omnichannel = identity resolution + dedup across channels (orchestration outside the engine).
- **Predictive collections** — pre-emptive intervention using the recovery model; depends on Phase 1–2 data.
- **Autonomous recovery** — self-optimizing within strict policy; humans retain settlement/restructuring/legal/vulnerable decisions; gate retains veto. *Autonomy increases; accountability does not move.*

